eadLock with features, prices and statuses - choose without extra clicks. How often are Deadlock cheats updated? We monitor Valve patches 24/7 and release updates within the first hours after a patch goes live. All features are tested before release. About DeadLock our cheats Cheats for Deadlock — Buy Premium Deadlock Cheats 2026 with Undetected Guarantee on ForgeCheats Deadlock is an innovative multiplayer game from Valve, combining a dynamic third-person hero shooter with deep MOBA mechanics. Previously known as Project 8 or Citadel, the game entered early access and continues to actively develop in 2026: regular balance patches, new heroes, map and mode updates. In Deadlock, two teams of 6 players battle on a large map with multiple lanes. The main objective is to destroy the enemy Patron by collecting souls, leveling up heroes, destroying towers, controlling neutral objectives, and coordinating team actions. It perfectly combines precise projectile shooting like in modern shooters with strategic gameplay like Dota 2: creeps, monster camps, items, powerful ultimates, rail-based movement, and fast rotations. Over 20 unique heroes with distinct abilities — from mobile assassins and snipers to tanks and controllers. Matches last about 30–45 minutes and require not only accuracy but also tactical thinking. Deadlock is already called one of Valve's most promising projects, and interest in the game is only growing in 2026. If you want to win consistently, master complex characters quickly, climb the ranks, or simply get maximum enjoyment from every match — premium cheats for Deadlock will be a reliable solution. On our platform https://forgecheats.com/ only paid subscriptions are available: no free versions, no risky public hacks. We offer exclusively private, regularly updated, and maximally secure cheats, tested against the latest Valve patches of 2026. Why buy premium cheats for Deadlock? Deadlock is a highly competitive game where even small advantages decide the m